      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For the catering team, send a detailed, consolidated dietary needs list immediately, clearly separating nut allergies, vegan requirements, and any other specific restrictions. Ensure their plan includes separate preparation and serving areas to prevent cross-contamination, which is critical for allergies. To label the buffet, use clear, color-coded signs identifying every dish's ingredients (e.g., \"Vegan,\" \"Contains Nuts,\" or \"Gluten-Free\"). This visible labeling allows guests to make safe, informed choices quickly.",
